  "non_inference_rules": [
    "An intelligence/security agency is not placed in Swamp merely because it is secretive.",
    "A person is not a member of a gang/cult/extremist group without documented evidence.",
    "Being named in a document, contact list or archive is not participation or guilt.",
    "A designation/classification must name the issuing body and date.",
    "Historical status must not be silently presented as current.",
    "No tactical instructions, evasion guidance, target selection or private identifying data."
  ],
  "foundation_questions": [
    "Who/what founded the organization or network?",
    "Was foundation legal, ideological, social, market-based or clandestine?",
    "What rules/norms make membership intelligible?",
    "How are people recruited, initiated, credentialed or trusted?",
    "What material resources sustain it?",
    "How is discipline/enforcement maintained?",
    "How does succession or fragmentation work?",
    "What rebrands/refoundations followed disruption?",
    "What institutions investigate, constrain or repair it?"
